    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "No. 15 The Meadows is simply a gorgeous 3 bedroom residence situated in a top class residential area close to all amenities, shopping centres, schools, church, Parkmore, and many employment hubs. Plus it has easy access to Galway Clinic, ATU, and the city centre.\n\nNo. 15 is double glazed and has dual central heating, a lovely en-suite off master bedroom, excellent carpets, and a fantastic rear garden. Off street parking to the front. It is exceptionally well decorated and maintained throughout.\n\nNo. 15 The Meadow comprises of an entrance hallway, sitting room with open fireplace, kitchen/ dining room, kitchen with hob and oven, utility room with washing machine. Downstairs WC and WHB. 3 superb bedrooms, all with built in units, en-suite off master bedroom, and main bathroom WC and WHB. Fabulous rear gardens.\n\nThis is a first class family home, ready to walk into, and situated in a wonderful residential area. Close to Parkmore, Galway Clinic, ATU, and only 5/6 minutes to the city centre.\n\nDetails with John Quinn. 091 569 174. \n"
      },
